WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.160
We didn't have much time to talk, like about 20 seconds.

00:03.160 --> 00:06.660
They were, in retrospect, I'm glad I waited

00:06.660 --> 00:09.900
because this thing didn't work out too well.

00:09.900 --> 00:12.600
But we did talk, we had a good talk,

00:12.600 --> 00:15.120
and we agreed to meet next week, if that's of interest.

